    <subsection xml:id="LOs-1-6">
    <title>Review Learning Objectives</title>
    
    <p>After this lesson, you should be able to:</p>
    <remark>
      <title>1.6.A</title>
      <p>Identify the use of variables in an app while interacting with it.</p>
    </remark>

    <remark>
      <title>1.6.B</title>
      <p>Develop code for assignment statements using variables, and determine the values that are
        stored in the variables as a result.</p>
    </remark>

    <remark>
      <title>1.6.C</title>
      <p>Develop code to store and modify strings, and determine the output produced.</p>
